{"updated":"2026-09-27T11:05:53.761Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Spain return to action with hard-fought win at Wembley to extend streak. Elsewhere, ‘My hands are empty’: Displaced Palestinians struggle to survive. And the week in pictures: Trump hosts Xi, the pope visits France and floods ravage Thailand. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 0.9 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 3.5 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 45 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.6 near 74 km ESE of Kokopo, Papua New Guinea. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.34,0.37,0.41,0.45,0.5,0.52,0.55,0.58,0.6,0.65,0.77,0.85,0.96,1.21,1.32,1.37,1.41,1.43,1.47,1.5,1.52,1.54,1.59,1.64,1.7,1.76,1.81,1.85,1.88,1.93,1.96,2,2.04,2.09,2.14,2.17,2.22,2.26,2.31,2.36,2.4,2.46,2.52,2.59,2.71,2.8,2.97,3.01,3.04,3.08,3.13,3.18,3.24,3.35,3.44,3.5,3.58,3.62,3.68,3.73,3.77,3.82,3.84,3.87,3.92,3.95,3.97,3.99,4.04,4.09,4.17,4.23,4.3,4.37,4.43,4.55,4.6,4.66,4.68,4.75,4.87,5.02,5.17,5.68,5.77,5.86,5.93,5.99,6.04,6.09,6.14,6.19,6.26,6.29,6.34,6.4,6.46,6.48,6.5,6.57,6.66,6.73,6.79,6.83,6.87,6.92,6.99,7.04,7.07,7.12,7.15,7.21,7.26,7.34,7.41,7.45,7.51,7.57,7.65,7.67,7.71,7.74,7.78,7.84,7.88,8,8.03,8.09,8.13,8.16,8.22,8.26,8.35,8.39,8.45,8.51,8.57,8.64,8.71,8.77,8.81,8.88,8.94,9.03,9.11,9.2,9.25,9.3,9.36,9.4,9.47,9.53,9.59,9.66,9.78,9.93,10.37,10.48,10.54,10.59,10.65,10.68,10.74,10.79,10.83,10.95,10.97,11.02,11.09,11.17,11.24,11.31,11.36,11.45,11.48,11.54,11.59,11.61,11.64,11.68,11.7,11.74,11.77,11.83,11.89,11.97,12.09,12.26,12.32,12.64,12.71,12.78,12.86,12.95,13.02,13.07,13.13,13.19,13.21,13.